The tools on your PATH are these: `mkfs.ext4 --version` names am-fs-ext4.
Homebrew's e2fsprogs is keg-only; its mkfs.ext4 stays at $(brew --prefix e2fsprogs)/sbin/mkfs.ext4.
On Linux, the system's /usr/sbin/mkfs.ext4 wins if /usr/sbin is earlier on PATH.
Run `rust-fs-ext4 doctor` if a tool behaves unexpectedly.
